# MissFit Coaching - redirect map
#
# Source: MM-22 "Final Website Copy v4", section "Redirect Mapping - Retiring
# Pages", plus Israel in Slack on 2026-09-15: "I trust your judgment. We can
# redirect all of these sites to the closest equivalent page instead of a
# blanket homepage redirect."
#
# So nothing here lands on / any more. Every retired page goes to the page
# that inherited its job:
#
#   the coaching engagement, about, enquiry  ->  /method-and-proof
#   anything you could buy or download       ->  /essentials
#   articles and the newsletter              ->  /insights
#
# The live set is six pages: / , /essentials , /method-and-proof , /insights ,
# /terms , /policy. Terms and Privacy are deliberately absent from this file.
# So are /success and /thank-you: success is the Stripe return URL and
# redirecting it breaks checkout.
#
# Both spellings of each path are listed. Pages 308s /x.html to /x on its own,
# so the extensionless rule alone would work, but inbound links from the
# Teachable era are nearly all .html and one hop beats two.
#
# Cloudflare Pages takes the first match, so specific rules precede the
# directory wildcards at the foot of the file.


